#: ../../../user/security-in-qubes/firewall.rst:23
#: 07d7baed75b748cbaddeb6acc140bc05
msgid ""
"Note that if you specify a rule by DNS name it will be resolved to IP(s) *at "
"the moment the rules take effect* (including each time the qube or netvm "
"starts), and not on the fly for each new connection. This means it will not "
"work reliably for servers that have different IPs at different times as a "
"result of DNS-based load balancing."
